{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:FluidDynamics.ObservableMtc","@type":"LeanModule","name":"FluidDynamics.ObservableMtc","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Braided.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Rigid.Basic"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ObservableMTC.braiding_nonsymmetric","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ObservableMTC.braiding_nonsymmetric","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/observable-mtc.lean#L41-L41","doc":"Witness that the braiding is non-symmetric on some simple\nobject: there exists V with c ∘ c ≠ id. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ObservableMTC.level_ge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ObservableMTC.level_ge","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/observable-mtc.lean#L37-L37","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ObservableMTC.level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ObservableMTC.level","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/observable-mtc.lean#L36-L36","doc":"Finitely many simple-object labels indexed by Fin (N - 1),\nfor fixed root-of-unity level N ≥ 3. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ObservableMTC.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ObservableMTC.mk","kind":"ctor","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/observable-mtc.lean#L30-L30","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ObservableMTC","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ObservableMTC","kind":"class","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/observable-mtc.lean#L22-L42","doc":"**Observable modular tensor category** at level N:\na ribbon fusion category C with finitely many isomorphism\nclasses of simple objects and a non-degenerate braiding\n(modular S-matrix). The non-symmetric braiding is encoded\nby the field `braiding_nonsymmetric`.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:observable-mtc}`\nRef: [moore-seiberg1989] https://doi.org/10.1007/BF01238857 ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:observable-mtc","label":"def:observable-mtc","md":"quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/observable-mtc.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}